---
name: Mexican Firing Squad
ingredients:
  - type: Tequilla blanco
    amount: '2'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lime juice
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Grenadine
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Angostura bitters
    amount: '4'
    unit: dashes
    garnish: false
  - type: Lime
    amount: '1'
    unit: wheel
    garnish: true
category:
  - tequila
image: ../../images/cocktails/mexican-firing-squad/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.liquor.com/mexican-firing-squad-cocktail-recipe-5270686
---
1. Add all ingredients into a shaker with ice and shake until well-chilled.
1. Strain into a rocks glass over fresh ice.
1. Garnish with a lime wheel.
